        {
            "id": "tradingview:83273c8357db9:0",
            "title": "Mario Stifano Pushes for Changes at AIRWA INC. with 9.5% Stake",
            "description": "<div class=\"body-bgeA9NCs body-pP5gm7BF content-pP5gm7BF\"><div class=\"symbolsContainer-rV5QygYP logosContainer-WbDJg_kR\" data-no-swipe=\"true\"></div><div><span><p class=\"\"><span>Mario Stifano disclosed a 9.5% stake in AIRWA INC.'s common stock. He filed a Schedule 13D on Aug. 07, 2026 after buying 100,000 shares in late July on the open market. Stifano says the investment could drive changes in strategy and governance at the company.</span></p><p class=\"\"><strong class=\"root-Tkn6WL2y\"><span>Investor Intent</span></strong></p><p class=\"\"><span>Stifano plans to press AIRWA INC. on financing, dilution, and how it spends money, especially after the $30 million USDT payment for Hongkong Best Life Trade Co., Limited. He aims to engage directors, managers, and other holders to “review capital-raising practices, use of proceeds, corporate governance, and terms of related-party transactions.”</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>He also wants to explore a pivot that uses AIRWA INC. as a public platform for critical minerals deals, including a SPAC-like approach. Stifano may demand company records under Delaware law, saying he is “seeking to inspect the company’s books and records” to evaluate next steps.</span></p><p class=\"\"><strong class=\"root-Tkn6WL2y\"><span>Investor's Background</span></strong></p><p class=\"\"><span>Mario Stifano is a Canadian executive and investor based in Ontario with a background in the resources sector. He has led and financed mining and exploration companies, focusing on value creation through capital discipline and asset development. Stifano typically targets special situations where governance changes and strategic resets can unlock shareholder value.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>Original SEC Filing: </span><a class=\"link-zw5jRdec icon-zw5jRdec\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1674440/000214920826000001/xslSCHEDULE_13D_X02/primary_doc.xml\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">AIRWA INC. [ YYAI ] - SCHEDULE 13D - Aug. 07, 2026</a></p><section class=\"variant-secondary-Gmpzg_mv disclaimer-vMD6Mpww\"><b class=\"heading-wrapper-Gmpzg_mv\"><span class=\"heading-Gmpzg_mv\">Disclaimer</span></b><div class=\"content-Gmpzg_mv link-with-underline-Gmpzg_mv\"><span>This is an AI-powered summary. It may contain inaccuracies. Consider verifying important information with the source. Please note this summary is solely based on documents filed with the SEC.</span></div></section></span></div></div>",
